dio sets.  We will be regularly updating this experience with new DJs from around the world.\n\nThe Underground Room\nMassive screens beamed in with DJs playing some of the newest music, on giant screens move to the top-level using one of our exclusive dance cages.\n\nThe Sunset Bar\nHigh In The Sky Hangout out at our really cool sunset bar with smooth DJs playing banging tunes, grab a drink at our bar, and party the night away.  \n\nThe Time Machine  \nTransports you back in time.   We Recreate your favorite nights, clubs,  and sets.  From those  DJs who started it all (Club Classics)\n\nCUSTOM AVATARS\n\nWE NOW HAVE CUSTOM AVATARS.  \nPlease use the following link to build your own.\n\nhttps://clubmixed.readyplayer.me/\n\nTHEN USE THE LINK TO MAKE A SHORTCODE AND ENTER ON ENTRY TO THE CLUB\n\nhttps://tinyurl.com/app", "short_description": "Clubmixed presents its virtual reality club GO CLUBBING.  Create your own full-bodied avatar and explore our different clubbing environments and watch DJs from around the globe.  Dance, chat and, rave to your favorite DJs and look out for our special events. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.clubmixed.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Recognition Media", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.clubmixed.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2687655338230691"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": ["MUSIC_VIDEO", "SOCIAL", "SPORTS"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD_VIA_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_i